"System Default follows the language selected in macOS." = "「跟隨系統」會使用 Windows 中設定的語言。";
"Search all sources (⌘F)" = "搜尋所有來源（Ctrl+F）";
"Move to Trash" = "移到資源回收筒";
"\"%@\" can't be moved to the Trash because its volume doesn't have one. Delete it permanently? This can't be undone." = "「%@」無法移到資源回收筒，因為其所在的磁碟機沒有資源回收筒。要永久刪除嗎？此操作無法復原。";
"%d items can't be moved to the Trash because their volume doesn't have one. Delete them permanently? This can't be undone." = "%d 個項目無法移到資源回收筒，因為其所在的磁碟機沒有資源回收筒。要永久刪除嗎？此操作無法復原。";
"Are you sure you want to move \"%@\" to the Trash?" = "確定要將「%@」移到資源回收筒嗎？";
"Are you sure you want to move %d items to the Trash?" = "確定要將 %d 個項目移到資源回收筒嗎？";
"FileFluss is a dual‑panel file manager for macOS that lets you work with local folders and multiple cloud storage accounts side by side. It is built around a left and right panel — copy, move, sync, and compare files between them with a few clicks." = "FileFluss 是一款適用於 Windows 的雙面板檔案管理程式，可讓你並排處理本機資料夾和多個雲端儲存帳戶。它圍繞左右兩個面板建構——只需按幾下，即可在兩者之間複製、移動、同步和比較檔案。";
"**Search** (⌘F) — open the search window." = "**搜尋**（Ctrl+F）——開啟搜尋視窗。";
"Right‑click the toolbar and choose *Customize Toolbar…* to rearrange or hide buttons." = "將滑鼠指標停留在工具列按鈕上，大多數按鈕都會顯示簡短說明。";
"Open **Settings → Cloud Accounts** (⌘,)." = "開啟 **設定 → 雲端帳戶**（Ctrl+,）。";
"Sign in via the provider's authentication flow. FileFluss stores the tokens securely in your macOS Keychain." = "透過服務商的驗證流程登入。FileFluss 會將權杖儲存在 Windows 認證存放區中，並針對你的 Windows 使用者帳戶加密。";
"In **Settings → Cloud Accounts**, click the trash icon next to the account." = "在 **設定 → 雲端帳戶** 中，按一下帳戶旁邊的 **移除**。";
"Click **Search** in the toolbar, or press **⌘F**." = "按一下工具列中的 **搜尋**，或按 **Ctrl+F**。";
"Click the round X close button, press **Esc**, or click the red traffic‑light button." = "按一下圓形的 X 關閉按鈕、按 **Esc**，或按一下視窗的關閉按鈕。";
"**Double‑click** any file. Word documents open in Word, PDFs in Preview, images in your image viewer, and so on." = "**按兩下** 任意檔案。Word 文件會在 Word 中開啟，PDF 在你的 PDF 檢視器中開啟，影像在「相片」應用程式中開啟，依此類推。";
"Could not mount in Finder" = "無法連線為網路磁碟機";
"Reveal in Finder" = "在檔案總管中顯示";
"Open this account as a drive in Finder" = "將此帳戶連線為網路磁碟機";
"Each cloud account you mount in Finder keeps recently-downloaded files locally up to this size, so re-opening the same file is instant. New value applies to the next mount." = "每個連線為網路磁碟機的雲端帳戶會在本機保留最近下載的檔案，上限為此大小，以便再次開啟同一檔案時即時完成。新值將在下次連線磁碟機時生效。";
"Eject this drive from Finder" = "中斷此網路磁碟機的連線";
"Finder-Mount Read Cache" = "網路磁碟機讀取快取";
"Mount in Finder" = "連線為網路磁碟機";
"macOS / Finder Style" = "Windows / 檔案總管風格";
"Open in Finder" = "在檔案總管中開啟";
"Do you want to mount “%@” in Finder?" = "是否要將「%@」連線為網路磁碟機？";
"This account isn't mounted yet. Mounting it adds it as a drive in Finder so you can open this item there." = "此帳戶尚未連線為網路磁碟機。連線後，它會以磁碟機的形式出現在檔案總管中，讓你可以在該處開啟此項目。";
"Mount this account in Finder first — a cloud folder has no path a terminal can open." = "請先將此帳戶連線為網路磁碟機——雲端資料夾沒有終端機可以開啟的路徑。";
"A terminal can only open a folder that exists on this Mac. Mounting this account adds it as a drive in Finder, and the terminal opens inside it." = "終端機只能開啟這台電腦上存在的資料夾。將此帳戶連線為網路磁碟機後，它會出現在檔案總管中，終端機將在其中開啟。";
"2. Open DevTools (⌥⌘I in Chrome/Safari/Firefox)" = "2. 開啟開發人員工具（Chrome/Edge/Firefox 中按 F12）";
"Click Connect to sign in with your Box account. Your browser will open for authentication. Uploads are capped at 50 MB per file in this version." = "按一下「連接」以登入你的 Box 帳戶。你的瀏覽器將開啟以進行驗證。";
"FileFluss reads the key file once and stores its contents in the macOS Keychain — moving or deleting the original file later won't affect this account." = "FileFluss 只讀取一次金鑰檔案，並將其內容儲存在 Windows 認證存放區中，針對你的使用者帳戶加密——之後移動或刪除原始檔案不會影響此帳戶。";
"FileFluss uses your Mac's existing iCloud sign-in — no password needed here. iCloud Drive must be turned on in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud → iCloud Drive." = "FileFluss 使用 Windows 版 iCloud——此處無需密碼。請從 Microsoft Store 安裝 Windows 版 iCloud，使用你的 Apple 帳戶登入並開啟 iCloud 雲碟。";
"iCloud uses your Mac's system sign-in — there's nothing to edit here. Manage iCloud Drive in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud." = "iCloud 使用 Windows 版 iCloud 的登入——此處無可編輯內容。請在 Windows 版 iCloud 應用程式中管理 iCloud 雲碟。";
"Jottacloud has no public API, so FileFluss uses the same interface as the official command-line tool. The token is exchanged for a login that's stored in your keychain." = "Jottacloud 沒有公開 API，因此 FileFluss 使用與官方命令列工具相同的介面。權杖將被兌換為登入憑證，並加密儲存在 Windows 認證存放區中。";

