"Showing a cloud account as a drive needs the Windows \"WebClient\" service, which isn't installed on this PC. On Windows Server, add the \"WebDAV Redirector\" feature." = "將雲端帳戶顯示為磁碟機需要 Windows 的「WebClient」服務，但這台電腦上未安裝該服務。在 Windows Server 上，請新增「WebDAV 重新導向器」功能。";
"The Windows \"WebClient\" service is disabled, so the account can't appear as a drive. An administrator can set it to \"Manual\" in Services (services.msc)." = "Windows 的「WebClient」服務已停用，因此該帳戶無法顯示為磁碟機。系統管理員可以在「服務」（services.msc）中將其設為「手動」。";
"Windows' WebDAV redirector (the \"WebClient\" service) couldn't connect to FileFluss. Make sure the WebClient service isn't blocked by a policy or security software." = "Windows 的 WebDAV 重新導向器（「WebClient」服務）無法連線到 FileFluss。請確認 WebClient 服務未被原則或安全性軟體封鎖。";
"Windows only opens and saves files up to %@ on drives like this one. Larger files can still be copied with FileFluss itself. An administrator can raise the limit (FileSizeLimitInBytes of the WebClient service)." = "在此類磁碟機上，Windows 只能開啟和儲存不超過 %@ 的檔案。更大的檔案仍可透過 FileFluss 本身複製。系統管理員可以提高此限制（WebClient 服務的 FileSizeLimitInBytes）。";

